[gd_scene format=3]

; The Cistern, under the Nave (map offset (102, -4.5)): the hatch in the nave floor drops down a tall metal
; flue into a flooded vault of columns. The flue's walls are metal, so Mag-grip climbs back up to the hatch;
; without it the only way on is the west doorway to the Reliquary. A Gleaner picks over scrap by the door;
; a Limpet sleeps on a metal tank east of the flue, and a hard landing may wake it.

